---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
import { projects } from '../../data/projects.js';

const project = projects.find((p) => p.id === 'hospital-management');
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title={project.title}
  subtitle="Production MERN healthcare platform with multi-tier role-based access control, appointment conflict prevention, and transactional notifications."
  category={project.categoryBadge}
  number={project.number}
  repoUrl={project.repoUrl}
  technologies={project.technologies}
  description={project.description}
>
  <!-- 01 Overview -->
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">
      <span>01 / DOMAIN CONTEXT</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">Overview</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-[var(--text-muted)] font-sans leading-relaxed">
      The <strong>Hospital Management System</strong> is a full-stack web application designed to streamline clinic workflows, patient reservations, doctor shift allocations, and administrative oversight.
    </p>
    <p class="text-base text-[var(--text-muted)] font-sans leading-relaxed">
      Built with the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js), the platform enforces strict role-based access control (RBAC), prevents schedule collisions through server-side validation, and dispatches automated email receipts via Nodemailer.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- 02 Problem -->
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">
      <span>02 / OPERATIONAL CHALLENGE</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">The Problem</h2>
    <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] space-y-3 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] font-sans">
      <p>
        Manual hospital and clinic administration processes suffer from constant scheduling friction and security vulnerabilities:
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-primary)]">
        <li><strong>Double-Booked Appointments:</strong> Unvalidated client submissions frequently result in overlapping patient slots for the same doctor.</li>
        <li><strong>Role Privilege Escalation:</strong> Lack of centralized authorization middleware allows unauthorized access to sensitive patient medical histories.</li>
        <li><strong>Missing Patient Confirmation:</strong> Disconnected communication creates missed appointments without automated notifications.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 03 Architecture Diagram -->
  <section class="space-y-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">
      <span>03 / SYSTEM TOPOLOGY</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">Architecture & Data Flow</h2>

    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] font-mono text-xs">
      <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--accent)] uppercase mb-4 tracking-wider font-semibold">REQUEST LIFECYCLE & RBAC GATEWAY</div>
      
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold">REACT CLIENT UI (Tailwind + Axios)</span>
          <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">BEARER JWT HEADER</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center text-[var(--text-muted)] text-xs">↓</div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold">EXPRESS API GATEWAY & AUTH MIDDLEWARE</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold">JWT.VERIFY()</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center text-[var(--text-muted)] text-xs">↓</div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--accent)]/50 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold">RBAC GATE (Admin | Doctor | Patient)</span>
          <span class="text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold">ROLE AUTHORIZED</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center text-[var(--text-muted)] text-xs">↓</div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold">BUSINESS CONTROLLER & SLOT VALIDATION</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold">NO COLLISION</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center text-[var(--text-muted)] text-xs">↓</div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold">MONGODB (Mongoose) + NODEMAILER DISPATCH</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold">ATOMIC WRITE + SMTP</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 04 RBAC Model -->
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">
      <span>04 / ACCESS CONTROL</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)]">
        <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--accent)] uppercase font-bold mb-1">ROLE: ADMIN</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2 font-mono">Hospital Oversight</div>
        <ul class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] space-y-1 font-sans">
          <li>• Manage doctor records</li>
          <li>• Monitor global appointments</li>
          <li>• System-wide status reports</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)]">
        <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--accent)] uppercase font-bold mb-1">ROLE: DOCTOR</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2 font-mono">Clinical Practitioner</div>
        <ul class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] space-y-1 font-sans">
          <li>• View allocated patient list</li>
          <li>• Manage shift availability</li>
          <li>• Update appointment status</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)]">
        <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--accent)] uppercase font-bold mb-1">ROLE: PATIENT</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2 font-mono">Healthcare Seeker</div>
        <ul class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] space-y-1 font-sans">
          <li>• Browse doctors & specialties</li>
          <li>• Book available time slots</li>
          <li>• Receive confirmation emails</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 05 Business Logic: Appointment Validation -->
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">
      <span>05 / CORE BUSINESS RULES</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">Collision Prevention Logic</h2>
    <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] space-y-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] font-sans">
      <p>
        When an appointment booking request is received at <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[var(--text-primary)]">POST /api/appointments</code>, the controller executes a multi-step validation check:
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="p-3 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] text-[var(--text-primary)]">
          1. <strong>Validate Payload:</strong> Check required DoctorID, PatientID, appointment date, and time slot format.
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] text-[var(--text-primary)]">
          2. <strong>Verify Doctor Availability:</strong> Query database to confirm doctor is on active duty during the requested window.
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] text-[var(--text-primary)]">
          3. <strong>Check Duplicate Slot:</strong> Ensure no existing appointment exists with status <code class="text-[var(--accent)]">"CONFIRMED"</code> or <code class="text-[var(--accent)]">"PENDING"</code> for that exact doctor and time.
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] text-[var(--text-primary)]">
          4. <strong>Atomic Document Creation:</strong> Write new appointment record to MongoDB.
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] text-[var(--text-primary)]">
          5. <strong>Dispatch Notification:</strong> Trigger asynchronous Nodemailer SMTP worker to send email confirmation.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 06 Future Improvements -->
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">
      <span>06 / ROADMAP</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">Future Engineering Enhancements</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] font-sans">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-mono font-semibold">01.</span>
        <span>Real-time WebSocket notifications for instant doctor schedule change updates.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-mono font-semibold">02.</span>
        <span>Automated SMS gateway integration for multi-channel appointment reminders.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-mono font-semibold">03.</span>
        <span>Integration of automated billing invoice generation upon appointment conclusion.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</CaseStudyLayout>
